</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Also known as brown rats, Norway rats are larger and stronger than mice. They prefer to burrow and are typically found in </span><b>basements, gardens, garages, or under buildings</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">. These rats are capable of causing serious structural damage to homes and commercial properties.</span></p>
