<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">They are known carriers of dangerous diseases like </span><b>Leptospirosis and Rat-Bite Fever</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">. Their constant gnawing can also damage electrical wiring, increasing the risk of short circuits and fires.</span></p>
