<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Many homeowners try to tackle rodent issues using traps or store-bought poisons, but these methods rarely solve the problem completely. Rodents are smart, cautious, and fast learners — they quickly adapt to avoid traps or recognise harmful bait.</span></p>
