<p><a href=\"/../home/\"><b>7 States Pest Control</b> </a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">is a trusted name for </span><b>Melbourne rodent control</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, providing safe, reliable, and long-lasting pest management solutions. Their expert team uses advanced tools and eco-friendly treatments to tackle infestations of all sizes.</span></p>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here’s how their process works:</span></p>
<ol>
<li><b> Comprehensive Inspection</b></li>
</ol>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Technicians conduct a detailed property inspection to identify rodent species, nesting zones, and all possible entry points. This step ensures targeted and effective treatment.</span></p>
<ol start=\"2\">
<li><b> Safe and Targeted Treatment</b></li>
</ol>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Based on the findings, the team uses specialised baiting, trapping, and monitoring methods. All products and techniques are safe for households, pets, and the environment, complying with Australian standards.</span></p>
<ol start=\"3\">
<li><b> Preventive Measures</b></li>
</ol>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After the rodents are removed, technicians seal entry points and provide expert advice on preventing future infestations. This includes sanitation tips and maintenance guidance.</span></p>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The company’s approach is not just about elimination — it focuses on long-term prevention and peace of mind through environmentally responsible practices.</span></p>
<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prevention Tips to Keep Rodents Away</span></h6>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prevention is always better than cure. Even after a successful rodent treatment, maintaining proper hygiene and home maintenance can prevent future infestations.</span></p>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here are some effective prevention tips:</span></p>
<ol>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Seal Entry Points:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Close cracks, holes, and gaps in walls, doors, and vents.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Store Food Properly:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Keep all food in sealed containers, including pet food.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Dispose of Garbage Regularly:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Avoid leaving food waste overnight.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Keep Surroundings Clean:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sweep and mop floors to remove crumbs or spills.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Trim Gardens and Shrubs:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Avoid overgrown vegetation near walls or sheds.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Inspect Roofs and Basements:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Look for droppings or signs of nesting.</span></li>
<li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><b>Schedule Routine Inspections:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Professional pest checks every few months can help catch problems early.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Implementing these steps reduces the likelihood of rodents finding food and shelter in your home.</span></p>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rodents like </span><b>House Mice, Norway Rats, and Roof Rats</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are the most common pests causing trouble across Melbourne. Left unchecked, they can damage property, spread disease, and contaminate food — leading to expensive and dangerous consequences.</span></p>
<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The best way to handle an infestation is through professional </span><a href=\"/rodent-control-in-melbourne/\"><b>Melbourne rodent control</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> With the expertise of 7 States Pest Control, you get a complete solution that identifies, removes, and prevents rodent activity — ensuring your property stays safe and hygienic.</span></p>
<p><b>Don’t wait until rodents take over —</b><a href=\"/contact-us/\"><b> contact 7 States Pest Control </b></a><b>for fast, reliable, and lasting rodent control solutions in Melbourne.</b></p>
